  "schema:description": "Standard Operating Procedure (SOP) for digestion of murine lymph node using strong acid and hydrogen peroxide in heating block, followed by analysis of implant-related trace elements by ICP-MS. This document was prepared by the team of the research project &quot;Integrated systemic detection of pollutants in the human body&quot; (INSYDE-HU), n. P2022RJCHC, CUP: H53D23010450001, funded by funded by the PRIN 2022 framework of the Italian National Recovery and Resilience Plan (PNRR).",
